* osdi_bind: version=1.0 does not select a card with version=1.5
*
* dummy_mos conducts 1 mS, dummy_mos_alternate 2 mS.

.model version_one_five nmos level=72 version=1.5

v_version_one_five version_one_five 0 1
m_version_one_five version_one_five 0 0 0 version_one_five

.control
pre_osdi dummy_modules.osdi
pre_osdi_bind mos 72 dummy_mos version=1.0
pre_osdi_bind mos 72 dummy_mos_alternate version=1.5
op
print i(v_version_one_five)
.endc

.end
